post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
==> Upscale Relay server, per user:
    1. Model sessions need ONNX Runtime and TensorRT (about 4 GB download):
         relay-server --install-nvidia-runtime
    2. Put .onnx models in ~/.local/share/upscale-relay/models
    3. Start the server now and at every login:
         systemctl --user enable --now upscale-relay-server
    Passthrough sessions work without step 1. Open TCP 8590-8591 (and UDP 5353
    for mDNS discovery) in your firewall for clients on the LAN.
EOF
}
